  "content": "UNITED STATES\nSECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION\nWashington, D.C. 20549\n\nFORM 10-K\nANNUAL REPORT PURSUANT TO SECTION 13 OR 15(d) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934\n\nFor the fiscal year ended December 31, 2023\n\nNVIDIA CORP\nTicker Symbol: NVDA\n\nPART I\n\nItem 1. Business\nNVIDIA CORP is a leading company in its industry sector.\n\nItem 7. Management's Discussion and Analysis\n\nFINANCIAL HIGHLIGHTS FOR 2023:\nRevenue: $347,000 million\nOperating Income: $86,750 million  \nNet Income: $52,050 million\nTotal Assets: $867,500 million\n\nCONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF INCOME\n(In millions)\n\nYear Ended December 31, 2023\n\nRevenue                 $347,000\nCost of Revenue         $208,200\nGross Profit           $138,800\nOperating Income        $86,750\nNet Income             $52,050\n\nCONSOLIDATED BALANCE SHEET\n(In millions)\n\nTotal Assets           $867,500\nTotal Liabilities      $347,000\nStockholders' Equity   $520,500"
